;    1: TDecorate(count=217, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=3661, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=25, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=65280, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ふじよしろう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=あん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=169, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=47, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=33, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=7, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=48, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=4674, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=4293, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, I'll leave your food here, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Thanks."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I hadn't eaten anything since dinner the day before, but I didn't feel especially hungry.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Every nerve I had was focused on my brain and my eyes.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">At first I'd struggled with the classical Japanese, but as I read, the feel of it from my entrance-exam days came back, and I'd become able to read it without </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> help.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had gotten photos of several foreign-language documents from me, but all of them seemed to be about 400 years old, and nothing in them looked like a clue.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Most of them were written by our ancestor Ginosuke Niimura, a Westerner naturalized in Japan, and apparently they tell what led him to make Droga, and about Droga experiments using </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ふじよしろう">Fujiyoshiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, who would later take the realm.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm having her translate those parts right now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">What I'm investigating now is mainly the events that have taken place in the Arata settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In particular, whether anything like the curse-killings ever happened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">History repeats itself; what happens twice will happen a third time. As those sayings go, I can't rule out that the same thing happened before.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My 'learning from the old' takes this angle.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, aren't you going to eat...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kana<STYLE ID="2"> called to me again, sounding worried.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, you look sleepy. Aren't you tired?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I'm fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Hearing the word 'tired,' I reflexively grabbed one of the rice balls </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="2"> had brought.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">A squishy feeling―</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, that's not a rice ball, it's an ohagi..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\おはぎ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">My hand, so completely convinced it was holding a rice ball, was sticky with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="あん">bean paste</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, you really should rest a little..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I'm fine, really. Thanks."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Still holding it in my bare hand, I put the ohagi in my mouth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A sticky meal, in more ways than one.</STYLE><PG>
"Is there anything I can help with?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kana<STYLE ID="2"> offered, but there was no work I could ask a fifth grader to do.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... When it's dinnertime, could you bring some up again?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Yeah... okay..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
Kana<STYLE ID="2"> took the empty ohagi plate and went back downstairs.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Was I a little too curt...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kana<STYLE ID="2"> helping out too would be nice if she could, but unfortunately it's far too hard for </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">There are only two days left.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I turned the pages with hands that were still just a little sticky.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">They say 'history repeats itself,' and sure enough, there seemed to have been more than a few incidents involving Droga.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Especially in Shiyo 340―460 years ago, at the time of the war between the Westerners and the indigenous people―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That time, Droga was apparently used recklessly, and many lives were lost in a terrible battle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And amid sprays of blood, people turned into the second and third generations, and it grew into instinctive mutual slaughter.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">The population of about 100 fell to 50, and it finally ended when the last third-generation person died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But 12 years later, in Shiyo 352, a girl named Tomi, the only one in the settlement born green-eyed, was apparently seized by that urge to kill when she had her first period.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Resisting it somehow, she took her own life, they say.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I understand how Tomi felt.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I've experienced that urge to kill too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It's beyond anything like holding back. Your arms and legs just move on their own.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Like an eyelid blinking by reflex when wind hits the eye, I tried to lunge at </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Before she could kill someone by reflex, she thrust her fingers through her eye into her brain and killed herself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Through this her body was preserved as a mummy, and she came to be worshipped as the goddess Verde.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">She became a mummy...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Was it even possible to make a mummy in Japan back then?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I looked it up on my phone...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I see. Even with the techniques of that time, making a mummy was possible.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, they say there were royals mummified in Africa even back in BC times.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If any of the Westerners back then had that skill, they could have made Tomi into a mummy.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Then is Verde's mummy still preserved somewhere even now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> might know something. I'll try asking her.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it's Chigaya."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Good work, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. How's it going?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... It's going well, if you can call it that. All sorts of facts have come out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And related to that, there's something I want to ask... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, have you ever heard of 'Verde's mummy'?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Verde's mummy...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Hmm... I wonder. I can't recall it right away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I see..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Have you asked </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">your grandmother</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... If I can, I'd like to hear it from someone outside the settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Outside the settlement...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Oh, I see what you mean. Well, it never hurts to be careful. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I'll think about it a little more on my end too. If I remember anything, I'll let you know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Though I'll be the only one arriving in Arata tonight, ahead of the others."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Thanks."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Her reaction was hard to read.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hiding something from me now, after coming this far, was hard to imagine, but it seemed she couldn't say for sure that Verde's mummy meant nothing to her either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">The phone in my hand vibrated.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had sent a long email.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Inside was a long run of translations of the foreign-language and classical texts.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There was also a note saying she wasn't sure she'd managed an accurate translation of the old foreign language.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said it seemed to be a sort of diary by a man named Ginosuke Niimura.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">After moving to the Arata settlement, he had also worked as a researcher of living things, apparently.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In particular, he had been investigating why the creatures of the Arata settlement grew so large.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And the likely cause was...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Many of the mammals living in the settlement had been seen digging up the roots of the Arata cherry and gnawing on them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ginosuke suspected there was some secret in the roots of these cherries.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">He seemed to have studied the roots by all kinds of methods.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">He discovered Droga a few years after moving to the Arata settlement.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">He studied every kind of plant and animal, looking for what made this soil so fertile.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Among them were the roots of the Arata cherry.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">He burned the Arata cherry roots he no longer needed, it seems―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">At that time, several residents working on the burning were apparently seized by a sudden euphoria.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And for twenty or thirty minutes at a stretch, they showed a strength that seemed beyond human.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ginosuke suspected that the roots had some effect that brought out monstrous strength.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">In the end, he succeeded in extracting Droga.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">He made it possible to draw human strength out to its limit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">To run that large-scale experiment, Ginosuke handed Droga to a man named </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ふじよしろう">Fujiyoshiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I see―so that was the trick behind winning out in the Warring States period and ruling the realm.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">From here on, it was the translation of the classical text I'd sent yesterday.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ginosuke never used Droga on himself, but to repay the Arata settlement that had taken him in, he wrote down how to refine it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So that they would use Droga well and bring eternal peace to this settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ironically, that was the beginning of the tragedy.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">There had been three mutations in all in this settlement, it said.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The first in Shiyo 340, the second in Shiyo 482, the third in Shiyo 768.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">From here on, it described the second and later ones.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Shiyo 482: one eye of the young Grand Witch of the time turned green.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And a hideously huge cherry tree grew.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The settlement stood on the brink of destruction, but it was saved at the cost of the young Grand Witch's life.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Shiyo 768: one of the residents found a dried-up corpse in an underground cave.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was a mummy wearing a Noh mask and red robes, and it was brought up above ground for a time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">From then on, the residents began acting strangely, and a dozen or more people disappeared.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> translation seemed to end there.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Let me sort this out a bit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The first, the Shiyo 340 affair...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">・Killing with Droga breaks out</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">・Killing by the green-eyed breaks out at the same time</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">The second, the Shiyo 482 affair...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">・One eye of the young Grand Witch of the time turns green</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">・A giant cherry tree nearly destroys the settlement</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">・The Grand Witch's life is used to escape the crisis</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">The third, the Shiyo 768 affair...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">・A mummy is found in an underground cave (Verde?)</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">・After that, the residents start acting strangely</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">・A year later, a dozen or more people disappear</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">The more I dig, the stranger the information that comes in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What bothers me most is the word 'disappearance'.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In the third case, they seem to have disappeared a year after the mummy was found.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And it's not as if everyone disappeared...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">To begin with, calling it a disappearance doesn't sit right with me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">People can't physically vanish into nothing, so if they disappeared, they either left the settlement or died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If they died, it should say they 'died,' not that they 'disappeared'...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So did they leave the settlement as a group after all?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Then where did the group that disappeared go?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And for what purpose did they disappear?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Just when I thought I understood the Green-Eye Curse-Killing and the Arata cherry, a new mystery blocks my way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And I don't even know whether this has anything to do with the curse-killings.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I'll report this part when the Motoki-cho group arrives and have them think it over with me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Verde's mummy, and the disappearances.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The only one who knows about these things is me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">or maybe not.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If they went to the trouble of fitting such a heavy door on the underground archive room, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> must know what the books say.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "50" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">What?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What does that mean...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What I just thought... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">isn't something off about it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Wait a minute... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Something's definitely wrong here, isn't it...!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">at least one of them, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, knows what's in these books, right?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">And I'm the one digging into it now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Why didn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> tell me what the books say?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "50" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Damn it...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_semarikuru.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I slam my fist down on the book as hard as I can.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">They got me...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="だま">I've been had</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So... that's how it is...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, at least one of them, is trying to </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="だま">deceive</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Here is my guess―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> both know I'm going through the books in the storehouse right now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But one of the two must know what books are in the storehouse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In that case, just telling me even roughly what the books say would get to the truth far faster.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵地下扉.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">My grounds for saying at least one of the two knows what the books say: that underground door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I don't know how many hundreds of years ago this storehouse was built, but the door is only about 10 years old.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In other words, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is guarding this information closely.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And that can only be because they know what the books say.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Then there's only one possibility―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">At least one of the two is covering up the truth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So no matter how much I go through the books here, I'll never reach the truth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'd better assume the most important documents have been disposed of or hidden.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">It's 3 p.m.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Right now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> should both be out getting ready for the thirteenth-year memorial service the day after tomorrow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Here isn't where I really need to be looking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The Niimura main house...!</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
